  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Spec Ops Tactical Fleece Vest is designed to deliver unparalleled performance and reliability in any mission or outdoor adventure. This midweight vest provides exceptional warmth and comfort, making it an ideal companion for cooler climates or chilly nights in the field. Whether you're a military professional, a tactical enthusiast, or an outdoor adventurer, this fleece vest is an essential piece of gear that combines functionality, durability, and comfort.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133333",
  "description": "<p>Our Spec Ops Tactical Fleece Vest is designed to deliver unparalleled performance and reliability in any mission or outdoor adventure. This midweight vest provides exceptional warmth and comfort, making it an ideal companion for cooler climates or chilly nights in the field. Whether you're a military professional, a tactical enthusiast, or an outdoor adventurer, this fleece vest is an essential piece of gear that combines functionality, durability, and comfort. Warm &amp; Comfortable: Crafted from warm polyester fleece, this outdoor vest will keep you warm all day and all night, no matter the location. These outdoor vests are easy to layer under or over other clothing, while offering additional insulation. Protection from the Elements: Equipped with a full zip main closure featuring a storm placket, this vest offers superior defense against the wind and cold. The drawstring bottom allows for a customized fit, ensuring the vest stays in place during intense activities. Flip up the mandarin collar for an extra layer of warmth and protection.&nbsp; &nbsp;Full Range of Motion: Acting as a sleeveless jacket, these rugged vests allow you to freely use your arms, which is extremely helpful when you&rsquo;re chopping wood, hiking a difficult trail, or driving through the mountains. In addition to adding a touch of resiliency, the polyester shoulder yoke enhances overall durability, making the vest more resistant to wear and tear. Utility Pockets: With practicality in mind, these fleece vests feature a left chest zipper pocket for conveniently securing and storing your essentials, like a phone, wallet, or keys. The front zipper hand pockets further enhance storage options, provide ample space for your valuables, and keep your hands warm when needed.</p>",
